THIRD-PARTY DATA ATTRIBUTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party data has been imported yet. Every source added to the database
must be recorded here and in DATA_SOURCES.md, with its licence, its attribution
text and the date its usage decision was approved, before any record from it is
merged.

Format for each entry:

  Source name
    Licence:      <licence and version>
    Attribution:  <exact attribution text required by the licence>
    Approved:     <date and link to the approving pull request>
    Scope:        <what was imported>

